{"lines":[{"w":0.063786010742187593,"t":"Test 3","y":0.033430232370254997,"h":0.017512052443900861,"c":1,"x":0.84362139782188095},{"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.06790123415105373,"y":0.11627906967349966,"w":0.057613169352213528},{"c":1,"y":0.13081395331928047,"t":"JAKE:","w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.065843620902124866},{"y":0.17711144208658625,"h":0.010602697185970178,"x":0.067826949283169291,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"w":0.057761739095052084},{"w":0.041152261098225909,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.065843622691627773,"y":0.20784883699069145},{"c":1,"y":0.25436046489550779,"x":0.065843621887284889,"w":0.061728394826253266,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.16244662866009038,"t":"properly. If it doesn't fit, we'll try to adjust it, or we'll find him another one - but he","y":0.080434836980530111,"w":0.64423431396484376,"h":0.018343806407196128,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.16447635552664178,"w":0.33162882486979162,"t":"must wear it all the time he's on the bike.","h":0.016652845241155734,"y":0.095378028839659179},{"w":0.087029603322346993,"c":1,"t":"Of course.","h":0.012833121246948909,"x":0.16436706462445239,"y":0.11339367954864121},{"w":0.64609054565429691,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Then after that, all the instructors will be waiting to meet their classes, and they'll","y":0.12779740851433563,"x":0.16255143501144989,"c":1},{"h":0.019291234100665355,"x":0.1624287573340206,"t":"meet up in the tent - you can't miss it. And each instructor will take their class","y":0.14222189703227572,"c":1,"w":0.61958648681640627},{"h":0.014628877066891977,"t":"away and get started.","x":0.16436834882629792,"y":0.15975529733577576,"c":1,"w":0.16929201761881513},{"x":0.16460906632080233,"t":"OK. Well that all sounds good. Now can you tell me how much the camp costs a","y":0.17432273271375232,"w":0.63786005655924483,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"w":0.055956885019938146,"y":0.18996856316198851,"h":0.013958222172426038,"t":"week?","x":0.16235077602896833,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.20494186031417205,"c":1,"t":"One hundred ninety-nine dollars. We've managed to keep the price more or less","x":0.16460906643044115,"w":0.63786005655924483},{"y":0.22084805634848992,"w":0.63991770426432293,"c":1,"x":0.16255143594478444,"t":"the same as last year - it was one hundred ninety then. But the places are filling","h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"up quite quickly.","x":0.16460905093174133,"c":1,"y":0.23837209290166372,"w":0.12757202148437502},{"x":0.16242850081785709,"h":0.016794958440378593,"y":0.25116831081599855,"c":1,"t":"Right. OK, well I'd like to book for ...","w":0.2903370412190755},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.20494186030908779,"t":"Q10","w":0.039094651540120484,"x":0.83539094573199724},{"w":0.10302087148030599,"x":0.067831127942828431,"c":1,"t":"PART 2","y":0.30207378651815742,"h":0.01503847344604059},{"c":1,"w":0.64627431233723964,"h":0.019297104421015732,"y":0.32704164257645052,"x":0.067810708892053997,"t":"Hello everyone. My name's Megan Baker and I'm a recruitment consultant at AVT"},{"t":"Recruitment specialists.","x":0.067901232518972093,"y":0.34447674402834472,"w":0.19341564178466794,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"t":"Now, our company specialises in positions that involve working in the agriculture and","x":0.0699141129378405,"y":0.36771451632152963,"c":1,"w":0.67087926228841144,"h":0.014923037291977193},{"h":0.018735336892315546,"y":0.3816375296275879,"c":1,"t":"horticulture sectors, so that's fresh food production, garden and park maintenance and so on.","w":0.7450190226236979,"x":0.065756274622809294},{"x":0.0657836573690498,"y":0.3981681196933704,"h":0.01693713566720545,"w":0.7305689493815104,"c":1,"t":"And these sectors do provide some very special career opportunities. For a start, they often"},{"t":"offer opportunities for those who don't want to be stuck with a 40-hour week, but need to","w":0.70987655639648439,"x":0.065843614945496828,"h":0.014534883982160629,"y":0.41424418590848067,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.81685083810692238,"t":"Q11\/Q12","w":0.074117253621419299,"h":0.011765934974481751,"y":0.41417517203073484},{"y":0.42834686591064153,"w":0.74495936075846347,"c":1,"h":0.016501077353181959,"t":"juggle work with other responsibilities such as child care - and this is very important for many","x":0.063730612464357253},{"y":0.44424469914972553,"h":0.017815166423963857,"w":0.71824117024739587,"t":"of our recruits. Some people like working in a rural setting, surrounded by plants and trees","x":0.065778696548540835,"c":1},{"x":0.065797053985442541,"y":0.45923570236626121,"w":0.82520889282226551,"t":"instead of buildings, although we can't guarantee that. But there are certainly health benefits, Q11\/Q12","h":0.017841623304027943,"c":1},{"t":"especially in jobs where you're not sitting all day looking at a screen - a big plus for many","c":1,"x":0.065787029912889358,"y":0.47510904888969085,"w":0.71410939534505213,"h":0.017260088656619765},{"y":0.4907553988833786,"x":0.065777591963156676,"w":0.72853006998697911,"c":1,"t":"people. Salaries can sometimes be good too, although there's a lot of variety here. And you","h":0.017553547386286339},{"y":0.50726744171353866,"x":0.065843629184361513,"t":"may have the opportunity in some types of jobs for travel overseas, although that obviously","w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.015995219964161089,"c":1},{"h":0.016726389369357997,"c":1,"t":"depends on the job, and not everyone is keen to do it.","y":0.52166398248307622,"x":0.067835963215209599,"w":0.42813934326171865},{"c":1,"w":0.68118754069010423,"y":0.54434939906395519,"t":"Of course, working outdoors does have its challenges. It's fine in summer, but can be","x":0.067832658751733887,"h":0.018394757777417392},{"c":1,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"extremely unpleasant when it's cold and windy. You may need to be pretty fit for some jobs,","x":0.065843611936147961,"y":0.56095406349636789,"w":0.72839508056640623},{"c":1,"x":0.065789727508917081,"t":"though with modern technology that's not as important as it once was. And standards of","y":0.57555728309253196,"h":0.016606397145768836,"w":0.701756591796875},{"x":0.065843627279485686,"t":"health and safety are much higher now than they used to be, so there are fewer work-related","w":0.73868311564127609,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.59156976730887023},{"t":"accidents. But if you like a lively city environment surrounded by lots of people, these jobs","y":0.60747938769515397,"c":1,"x":0.065843621937305086,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.71810699462890626},{"y":0.62069725723681268,"h":0.017862790605345125,"t":"are probably not for you - they're often in pretty remote areas. And some people worry about","w":0.7408749389648438,"x":0.065782095114041109,"c":1},{"w":0.62973495483398434,"h":0.016697063041660076,"y":0.63737253115422077,"c":1,"x":0.067851120747349392,"t":"finding a suitable place to live, but in our experience, this usually turns out fine."},{"y":0.68313953513306525,"x":0.069958874409541211,"w":0.7037036641438803,"h":0.014534882858869502,"t":"Now let me tell you about some of the exciting jobs that we have on our books right now.","c":1},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.067901240750274025,"w":0.68106994628906248,"y":0.70784883707636514,"t":"One is for a fresh food commercial manager. Our client here is a very large fresh food"},{"x":0.067798093678269097,"h":0.018019471207833204,"t":"producer supplying a range of top supermarkets. They operate in a very fast-paced","c":1,"w":0.66274383544921878,"y":0.72200738557576616},{"h":0.014572547939556646,"y":0.73837209288971017,"w":0.73868311564127598,"c":1,"t":"environment with low profit margins - the staff there work hard, but they play hard as well, so","x":0.067901240464822668},{"c":1,"y":0.7543604649679545,"t":"if you've a sociable personality this may be for you.","w":0.41358024597167969,"x":0.065843621751096745,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"t":"We have an exciting post as an agronomist advising farmers on issues such as crop nutrition,","w":0.74485595703124996,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.067901239485533824,"c":1,"y":0.77761627893706387},{"y":0.79104151357639618,"w":0.74292785644531245,"c":1,"h":0.01622348118165351,"x":0.069888268076907137,"t":"protection against pests, and the latest legislation on farming and agricultural practices. There"},{"c":1,"w":0.74485595703125007,"t":"are good opportunities for the right person to quickly make their way up the career ladder, but","x":0.067901239522030032,"y":0.80800942279550403,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"t":"a deep knowledge of the agricultural sector is expected of applicants.","c":1,"h":0.017900039506604459,"x":0.067823696033544392,"y":0.82238505660733985,"w":0.55362670898437505},{"y":0.84552107253563469,"t":"A leading supermarket is looking for a fresh produce buyer who is available for a 12-month","x":0.06781530188149891,"w":0.72239435831705734,"h":0.018293591916069718,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.067901231358359654,"w":0.74279836018880208,"h":0.014538307774052961,"y":0.86336866909772025,"t":"maternity cover contract. You need to have experience in administration, planning and buying"},{"y":0.87926972886810817,"t":"in the fresh produce industry, and in return will receive a very competitive salary.","h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.63991770426432293,"x":0.067901230074330438,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.83744856028037851,"y":0.7223837207742041,"c":1,"t":"Q15","w":0.037037035624186254},{"x":0.83950617344305101,"y":0.80668604635319485,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q16","w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1},{"w":0.039094648361206019,"c":1,"y":0.84593023230977182,"t":"Q17","x":0.83744856073709251,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.8703703707516327,"y":0.90843023239970644,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"111","c":1},{"x":0.71959372764437479,"y":0.95567424193315942,"h":0.025468114127259134,"c":1,"w":0.25219902038574227,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3396,"w":2400}